hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18100","Abdullah ibn Yazid narrated to us, he said: Haywah ibn Shurayh narrated to us, Abu Uthman al-Walid ibn Abi al-Walid al-Madani narrated to us that Imran ibn Abi Anas narrated to him from Abu Khirash al-Sulami that he heard the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saying: Whoever boycotts his brother a year, it is as shedding his blood."
